    // Session quotes - calm
    quote_calm_0:"Calm is not the absence of storm, but peace in the middle of it.",
    quote_calm_1:"In the silence you find the strength the noise takes from you.",
    quote_calm_2:"Breathing is the anchor that keeps you here and now.",
    quote_calm_3:"Every moment of calm is a gift to yourself.",
    quote_calm_4:"Not everything needs a solution right now. Sometimes just being is enough.",
    quote_calm_5:"The world can wait. This minute belongs to you.",
    // sleep
    quote_sleep_0:"Every breath brings you closer to the rest you deserve.",
    quote_sleep_1:"The day is over. You can let go.",
    quote_sleep_2:"Sleep is not a luxury – it's your natural right.",
    quote_sleep_3:"With every exhale, the weight of the day lifts from your shoulders.",
    quote_sleep_4:"The night is your ally. Trust it.",
    quote_sleep_5:"Your body knows what it needs. Give it rest.",
    // focus
    quote_focus_0:"Clarity comes when you pause for a moment.",
    quote_focus_1:"Concentration is not pressure, it's a conscious choice.",
    quote_focus_2:"A quiet minute creates space for clear thoughts.",
    quote_focus_3:"You don't have to be perfect to be productive.",
    quote_focus_4:"Focus is not hardness, it's presence.",
    quote_focus_5:"Small breaks make great results possible.",
    // emotion
    quote_emotion_0:"Your feelings are valuable. You're allowed to take time.",
    quote_emotion_1:"It's okay not to be okay.",
    quote_emotion_2:"Feelings are like waves – they come and go.",
    quote_emotion_3:"You don't have to understand everything right away. Just feel.",
    quote_emotion_4:"Your emotions make you human, not weak.",
    quote_emotion_5:"Sometimes feeling is the first step to healing.",
    // parent
    quote_parent_0:"You're doing your best. That's enough.",
    quote_parent_1:"Parents need breaks too. You're allowed to take one.",
    quote_parent_2:"Perfection doesn't exist. But loving – you can do that.",
    quote_parent_3:"Your energy is valuable. Protect it.",
    quote_parent_4:"It's okay not to have all the answers.",
    quote_parent_5:"You are more than your role. You are also human.",
    // work
    quote_work_0:"This minute is yours. Nobody else's.",
    quote_work_1:"Breaks aren't a waste of time – they're investments in you.",
    quote_work_2:"You don't always have to be 'on'.",
    quote_work_3:"Even small moments of calm make a difference.",
    quote_work_4:"Your work isn't going anywhere. But your energy is.",
    quote_work_5:"Inhale. Exhale. Continue. In that order.",
    // thoughts
    quote_thoughts_0:"Thoughts are like clouds – let them come and go.",
    quote_thoughts_1:"You don't have to think every thought through to the end.",
    quote_thoughts_2:"Ruminating is like rocking – lots of movement but you don't get anywhere.",
    quote_thoughts_3:"Sometimes saying stop is the bravest thing you can do.",
    quote_thoughts_4:"Your mind is allowed to rest. Not everything needs to be solved now.",
    quote_thoughts_5:"A clear head sometimes just needs: nothing.",
