    // Haftung
    legal_haftung_notice_title:"Important Notice",
    legal_haftung_notice_body:"StillMind is a wellness and relaxation application for general well-being.",
    legal_haftung_no_medical_title:"Not a substitute for medical treatment",
    legal_haftung_no_medical_body:"This app does NOT replace diagnosis, advice or treatment by a doctor, psychotherapist or other medical professional. The exercises are exclusively for general relaxation and stress management in everyday life.\n\nFor health complaints, mental health issues or chronic conditions, please always consult a qualified doctor or therapist.",
    legal_haftung_crisis_title:"In acute crises",
    legal_haftung_crisis_body:"If you are in an acute crisis or have thoughts of self-harm, please contact immediately:\n\n• Emergency: 112\n• Crisis helpline: 0800 111 0 111 or 0800 111 0 222\n• Your doctor or psychiatrist",
    legal_haftung_disclaimer_title:"Disclaimer",
    legal_haftung_disclaimer_body:"Use of the app is at your own risk. We accept no liability for damages arising from the use or non-use of the content.\n\nThe information in this app has been compiled to the best of our knowledge but makes no claim to completeness or accuracy. StillMind is a product to support personal well-being and does not replace professional medical or therapeutic care.",
    // Datenschutz
    legal_privacy_docs_title:"Legal Documents",
    legal_privacy_docs_body:"Here you find the most important information in the app. The full versions are additionally available online:",
    legal_privacy_docs_hint:"Note: External links open in the browser. If a link is temporarily unavailable, this page remains accessible.",
    legal_privacy_section1_title:"Privacy & Data Security (Summary)",
    legal_privacy_section1_p1:"StillMind is designed so that all usage data is processed exclusively locally on your device.",
    legal_privacy_section1_p2:"Your personal data is not stored or analysed on our own servers.",
    legal_privacy_section1_p3:"The following data remains locally on your device:",
    legal_privacy_local_1:"Time and type of completed exercises",
    legal_privacy_local_2:"App settings (e.g. sounds, vibration)",
    legal_privacy_local_3:"your current premium status within the app",
    legal_privacy_section2_title:"Use of platform and third-party services",
    legal_privacy_section2_body:"When downloading and using the app, technically necessary services of the respective platform are used (Apple App Store / Google Play). These services process data under their own responsibility in accordance with their privacy policies, including for providing the app, processing in-app purchases, system security and stability, and fraud prevention. We have no direct access to this platform- and system-related data.",
    legal_privacy_revenuecat_title:"RevenueCat",
    legal_privacy_revenuecat_body:"For managing in-app purchases (subscriptions and one-time purchases), StillMind uses RevenueCat. RevenueCat processes technical information necessary for validating and restoring purchases. This includes: anonymised user ID (device-generated), connection data (system-related) and purchase and transaction data. The purpose of processing is exclusively to provide, validate and restore your in-app purchases.",
    legal_privacy_notif_title:"Notifications & Reminders",
    legal_privacy_notif_body:"StillMind can optionally show daily reminders. These are scheduled locally on your device and require no server connection. Notifications can be disabled at any time in your device system settings.",
    legal_privacy_audio_title:"Audio content & streaming",
    legal_privacy_audio_body:"For background music, audio files may be loaded via external URLs. Your IP address is transmitted to the respective server to deliver the file. StillMind does not store or use these connection details.",
    legal_privacy_no_medical_title:"No medical data",
    legal_privacy_no_medical_body:"StillMind does not collect or process medical diagnoses or health data within the meaning of the GDPR. All content is exclusively for general relaxation.",
    legal_privacy_terms_title:"Terms of Use (Summary)",
    legal_privacy_terms_body:"StillMind provides content for relaxation and personal well-being. The content does not replace medical or therapeutic treatment. Premium features can be unlocked via subscription or one-time purchase, billed through the Apple App Store or Google Play. Prices, durations and cancellation terms are governed by the respective store terms. Purchases can be reactivated via \"Restore purchases\". Misuse, automated use or interference with the app is prohibited.",
    legal_privacy_contact_title:"Contact",
    legal_privacy_contact_body:"For questions about privacy or terms of use, contact us at:",
    legal_privacy_extern_policy:"Privacy Policy (external):",
    legal_privacy_extern_terms:"Terms of Use (external):",
    legal_privacy_extern_revenuecat:"RevenueCat Privacy:",
